{
  "sn55.7:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 55.7 ",
  "sn55.7:0.2": "1. Veḷudvāravagga ",
  "sn55.7:0.3": "Veḷudvāreyyasutta ",
  "sn55.7:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn55.7:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosalesu cārikaṁ caramāno mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ yena veḷudvāraṁ nāma kosalānaṁ brāhmaṇagāmo tadavasari. ",
  "sn55.7:1.3": "Assosuṁ kho te veḷudvāreyyakā brāhmaṇagahapatikā: ",
  "sn55.7:1.4": "“samaṇo khalu, bho, gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito kosalesu cārikaṁ caramāno mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ veḷudvāraṁ anuppatto. ",
  "sn55.7:1.5": "Taṁ kho pana bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ evaṁ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato: ",
  "sn55.7:1.6": "‘itipi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā’. ",
  "sn55.7:1.7": "So imaṁ lokaṁ sadevakaṁ samārakaṁ sabrahmakaṁ sassamaṇabrāhmaṇiṁ pajaṁ sadevamanussaṁ sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā pavedeti. ",
  "sn55.7:1.8": "So dhammaṁ deseti ādikalyāṇaṁ majjhekalyāṇaṁ pariyosānakalyāṇaṁ sātthaṁ sabyañjanaṁ, kevalaparipuṇṇaṁ parisuddhaṁ brahmacariyaṁ pakāseti. ",
  "sn55.7:1.9": "Sādhu kho pana tathārūpānaṁ arahataṁ dassanaṁ hotī”ti. ",
  "sn55.7:2.1": "Atha kho te veḷudvāreyyakā brāhmaṇagahapatikā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā appekacce bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Appekacce bh